{'symbol': 'ZTS', 'date': '2021-11-17 11:47:00', 'title': 'ZOETIS AWARDED THE BEST PLACE TO WORK CERTIFICATION IN SOUTH AFRICA FOR 2021', 'text': 'JOHANNESBURG--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #SOUTHAFRICA--ZOETIS, AN AFFILIATE OF THE GLOBAL ANIMAL HEALTH COMPANY, HAS BEEN OFFICIALLY RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE BEST PLACES TO WORK IN SOUTH AFRICA FOR 2021. EMPLOYEES RANKED THE COMPANY FAVORABLY IN ALL THE EIGHT WORKPLACE FACTORS OF THE CERTIFICATION – MORE THAN 88% OF EMPLOYEES SAID THE COMPANY IS OFFERING A GREAT ATMOSPHERE AND PROVIDES CHALLENGING WORK, AND 99% OF EMPLOYEES ARE RECOMMENDING THE ORGANIZATION, 17 POINTS HIGHER COMPARED TO A TYPICAL SOUTH AFRICAN COMPANY'}